{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function memoryStream(source, options?): UpsertableStreamDurability;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-durability.ts#L331","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/stream-durability.ts:331"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The zero-infrastructure delivery-durability backend. Its versioned cursor is\ndeliberately private: callers and core only pass the returned string back."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Construct from the incoming "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Request"},{"type":"text","value":" (HTTP transports) or from an explicit\n"},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/MemoryStreamInit.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"MemoryStreamInit"}]},{"type":"text","value":" (server functions / direct calls that already know\nthe run id)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Logs live in a process-global map, so this backend is for development, tests,\nand single-process deployments only. Completed runs are evicted after a grace\nwindow (see COMPLETED_LOG_TTL_MS); a resume of an evicted or unknown\nrun fails loudly rather than hanging."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"source","children":[{"type":"text","value":"source"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Request"},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/MemoryStreamInit.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MemoryStreamInit"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/MemoryStreamOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MemoryStreamOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{}"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/UpsertableStreamDurability.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"UpsertableStreamDurability"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"source","text":"source","level":3},{"id":"options","text":"options?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction memoryStream(source, options?): UpsertableStreamDurability;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-durability.ts:331](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-durability.ts#L331)\n\nThe zero-infrastructure delivery-durability backend. Its versioned cursor is\ndeliberately private: callers and core only pass the returned string back.\n\nConstruct from the incoming `Request` (HTTP transports) or from an explicit\n[MemoryStreamInit](../interfaces/MemoryStreamInit.md) (server functions / direct calls that already know\nthe run id).\n\nLogs live in a process-global map, so this backend is for development, tests,\nand single-process deployments only. Completed runs are evicted after a grace\nwindow (see COMPLETED\\_LOG\\_TTL\\_MS); a resume of an evicted or unknown\nrun fails loudly rather than hanging.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### source\n\n`Request` \\| [`MemoryStreamInit`](../interfaces/MemoryStreamInit.md)\n\n### options?\n\n[`MemoryStreamOptions`](../interfaces/MemoryStreamOptions.md) = `{}`\n\n## Returns\n\n[`UpsertableStreamDurability`](../interfaces/UpsertableStreamDurability.md)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: memoryStream\ntitle: memoryStream\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction memoryStream(source, options?): UpsertableStreamDurability;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/stream-durability.ts:331](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/stream-durability.ts#L331)\n\nThe zero-infrastructure delivery-durability backend. Its versioned cursor is\ndeliberately private: callers and core only pass the returned string back.\n\nConstruct from the incoming `Request` (HTTP transports) or from an explicit\n[MemoryStreamInit](../interfaces/MemoryStreamInit.md) (server functions / direct calls that already know\nthe run id).\n\nLogs live in a process-global map, so this backend is for development, tests,\nand single-process deployments only. Completed runs are evicted after a grace\nwindow (see COMPLETED\\_LOG\\_TTL\\_MS); a resume of an evicted or unknown\nrun fails loudly rather than hanging.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### source\n\n`Request` \\| [`MemoryStreamInit`](../interfaces/MemoryStreamInit.md)\n\n### options?\n\n[`MemoryStreamOptions`](../interfaces/MemoryStreamOptions.md) = `{}`\n\n## Returns\n\n[`UpsertableStreamDurability`](../interfaces/UpsertableStreamDurability.md)\n"}
